      "text": "Strumento monouso da dare a un Pokémon.\nPermette l’uso immediato di una mossa che in\ngenere richiede un turno prima di essere eseguita.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A single-use item to be held by a Pokémon. It\nallows the holder to immediately use a move that\nnormally requires a turn to charge.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせた　ポケモンは　１度だけ\n１ターン目に　ちからを　ためる技を\nすぐに　使うことが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带它的宝可梦仅有１次机会\n可以在第１回合使出\n需要蓄力的招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permite el uso inmediato de cualquier movimiento en el\nprimer turno. Es de un solo uso y debe llevarla un\nPokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
